      "title": "Duo Oil La La",
      "subtitle": ".tag-badge{\ndisplay:none;\n}\n\nTreat your skin like something you love.\n\nDon't believe the rumors. Oils aren't the enemy of oily, breakout-prone skin. Oil La La uses a blend of nourishing oils that are non-comedogenic to create balance, preventing and soothing breakouts.\n\nWhy is it different: Targets the root cause of breakouts by transforming acne-causing sebum with linoleic acid-rich oils to soothe and prevent breakouts - prioritizing balance and barrier health above all else.\n\nHelps with: Balancing sebum production to prevent future breakouts, supporting a healthy skin barrier, and targeting congestion without harsh ingredients.\n\nMade for: All skin types, especially oily, breakout-prone skin.\n\nClinically Proven:\n\nDecrease in sebum production over time after regular use.\n\nImproved barrier function and soothed redness after one use.\n\nBased on an independent clinical study on 20 participants.\n\nConsumer Trial Test:\n\n98% noticed an overall clearer complexion after using this serum.\n\n96% agreed the serum layered well with other skincare products.\n\n88% noticed their skin looked clearer & more balanced.\n\n88% agreed their skin feels noticeably smoother.\n\nResults from consumer trial on 25 participants over 4 weeks. Individual results may vary.\n\nBonus: Our packaging allows you to use up every last drop!\n\nIncludes:\n\n2 full-size Oil La La (45 mL / 1.52 fl oz)\n\nNOTE: Not recommended for those with psoriasis or a history of skin cancer. Please consult with your doctor or dermatologist first!",
